proach to Uranus took place at 17:59 ED Jan. 24, 1986,\",\"corrects\":\"Jan. 24, 1968\",\"basis\":\"own-knowledge\",\"source\":\"\",\"reason\":\"Uranus flyby was 24 Jan 1986; 1968 predates Voyager.\"},{\"statement\":\"during their space shuttle launch Jan. 28, 1986.\",\"corrects\":\"launch Feb. 28, 1986\",\"basis\":\"own-knowledge\",\"source\":\"\",\"reason\":\"Challenger launched and was lost on 28 January 1986.\"}]}","ttft_ms":13081,"type":"result","duration_ms":23580,"uuid":"dede6790-121c-4537-b5e4-eb3cc11391fe","ttft_stream_ms":1612,"time_to_request_ms":88,"first_content_frame_ms":1612,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
